<title>UK: Spain sets 150 billion yen 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Spain sets 150 billion yen 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPAIN</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN YEN   COUPON     3.10	MATURITY    20.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.07    PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    100.07    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (M) =1-10-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGGLISH  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	DIRECT, UNCONDITIONAL, UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
